      <title>英伟达开源PAIR：局域网内自动调度M4 Mac与RTX PC运行本地AI</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260904/%E8%8B%B1%E4%BC%9F%E8%BE%BE%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90PAIR%E5%B1%80%E5%9F%9F%E7%BD%91%E5%86%85%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E8%B0%83%E5%BA%A6M4-Mac%E4%B8%8ERTX-PC%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0AI/</link>
